B.apM=s(["Each voice-parsed field now has its own subtle card and category label, making dates, titles, amounts, and other values easier to scan.","Edit pencils now sit inside a white framed button with a border and shadow, making the action area clearer.","Edit buttons align with the top category label, while read-only rows reserve the same action-column width for a consistent layout."],t.s)
