B.aqw=s(["After the dashboard tour, the assistant guides users through a voice sample, parsed preview, and practice record creation.","The tutorial demonstrates the edit warning and typed Delete safeguard, then removes the practice record afterward.","Step-by-step manual entry keeps the active card at the top when questions change or the keyboard resizes."],t.s)
