B.anq=s(["Manual entry date fields now default to the device date instead of inheriting an accidentally selected calendar day.","The assistant recognizes dates such as August 19 without requiring a spoken day suffix.","Short phrases such as lunch expense 90 now separate the ledger title and amount correctly.","The updated launch flow, weekly and expanded calendars, and left-side currency selector are included in this release.","Android reminders now use the worCat icon and a short cat sound.","Android adds per-device reminder voice styles: meow only, standard, cute, energetic, or gentle."],t.s)
