B.auA=s(["The next-schedule card now refreshes every minute and automatically advances after the current event ends.","Added income, expense, and advance-expense filters to the ledger list; tap the selected filter again to show all records.","Condensed advance-expense tracking into summary cards that reveal progress, metadata, notes, and edit or delete actions when expanded."],t.s)
